   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Steppin'** (1 other source): The first few seconds of the song are missing from the recording [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Ne-Ne**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **'one more'**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2001-11-03.dAUD.at4041** (recommended): source not stated; 5 songs; 57 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Sam Kinninger played saxophone, and Neal Evans played Hammond B3, Wurlitzer and piano, as guests with the band [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2001-11-03.dAUD.at4041**: taped by Jack Wilkins; transferred by Vinny Isaia; source: AT4041 -> Sony D7 [1]. Also: Recorded with a Sony PCM-M1 into a Focusrite Scarlett 6i6, captured in REAPER, then edited in Audacity and converted to FLAC [1]",
